  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia Aid Advisory Services (CAAS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cambodia Aid Advisory Services investment supports advisory services for Phnom Penh Post including in design, monitoring, evaluation and performance and quality, and provides quality assurance and technical advice on key sectors including gender and social inclusion. The services provide Post with technical expertise to strengthen the influence and impact of Australian development assistance to Cambodia.</narrative>
